			title: "The Hole Row: Forges and Vaults"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1D979E61CB77D854"]
			description: ["The jet beam line, gamma optics works and magnetic pair converter shape the light and matter the shell needs. The three controllers. Probe navigation parts, and the stage's antimatter side. Pairs leave by pipe, light by beam; do not mix the lanes."]
