			description: ["The older rows still make parts MAX+ needs: diamond fab, implanter, aerogel works, coated conductor line, HTS magnet works, helium refrigerator, hot cell, extraction cascade, cryogenic plant and hot strip mill. The ten controllers, set up for many lanes. Conductors, aerogel, and a cold chain for the stage. Give each its own chest on the network."]
