		{
			dependencies: ["3232ED493BE40B9D"]
			description: ["The burner takes a shielded nickel-56 cask and returns a cobalt-56 cask, then a spent iron-56 cask. Heat becomes steam, and steam becomes EU on the platform. Casks from the crucible, and a dynamo hatch on the platform. The platform's own power and the way to send it home. Casks move by belt; send spent ones back home as scrap."]
			icon: "grindless:co56_cask"
