		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5DFE1272DB6130B6"]
			description: ["Primordial deuterium and pristine helium-3 fuel a torus on the platform. The fusion reactions are not new; the fuel comes from the Stream. Both fuels in bulk, and a torus. A second source for the platform's network. The fuels travel in separate pipes."]
