		}
		{
			dependencies: ["39270E38F40EA6A2"]
			description: ["Wireless energy hatches draw from the network, and a MAX+ store smooths out the dips between plants. The 4096-amp and 1024-amp wireless hatches, the MAX+ hatch and an SMES cell. Steady power for the machines that never stop. Size the store for the longest outage of the weakest plant."]
			icon: "grindless:max_smes_cell"
