		}
		{
			dependencies: ["57131618A8A6EBF3"]
			description: ["The 256M cell component and a horizon storage die make cells that hold the stage's item and fluid counts. The &6Horizon Storage Die&r from the circuits tab, and the 256M component. Storage that does not run out at a million of anything. One cell type per network; fluids get their own."]
