		{
			dependencies: ["73BAF6EEECC416D6"]
			description: ["The assembler matrix keeps hundreds of patterns in one block, and two pattern providers push them out. A pattern memory unit holds the plan. The matrix crafter, frame and walls, an extended provider, an expanded provider and the memory unit. Autocrafting of every item in the tab. Group patterns by line, and name them."]
