		{
			dependencies: ["57131618A8A6EBF3"]
			description: ["The MAX+ parallel hatch lets one machine run a very large batch at once. It does not make a recipe faster; it makes the plan fit. The &6parallel hatch&r, on a controller that accepts it. The scale of the final stage. A batch needs its inputs together, so size the buffer for it."]
